		{"id":"a000000000000010","type":"text","x":-240,"y":2060,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"5","text":"## ↑\n## QUALITY\n\n**Top** = elite ROIC, durable margins, FCF compounder\n**Mid** = solid moat, average returns\n**Bot** = poor ROIC, FCF burn, structural challenges"},
		{"id":"a000000000000011","type":"text","x":1950,"y":4300,"width":1500,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"## VALUATION (absolute) →\n\n**Left** = cheap (low fwd P/E, deep value) · **Mid** = market-average (~25x fwd) · **Right** = premium (50x+ fwd P/E)"},
